<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct crude imports fall 1.3 pct yr/yr-MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct crude imports fall 1.3 pct yr/yr-MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry on Friday issued the following data on crude oil imports during October 1996:</p>
<p> CRUDE OIL   (1,000 kl) (1,000 bbl) mth/mth% yr/yr%</p>
<p> Iran	   2,215	 13,932    -13.4    + 1.6</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia 4,427	 27,845    +31.5    + 5.5</p>
<p> Kuwait	 1,243	  7,818    +37.3    +36.6</p>
<p> Neutral Zone   971	  6,108    -24.5    -11.9</p>
<p> Qatar	  1,484	  9,334    + 8.8    +24.8</p>
<p> Oman	   1,568	  9,863    +62.5    +30.1</p>
<p> UAE	    5,960	 37,488    +15.1    - 9.9</p>
<p> Yemen	    137	    862    - 61.2   -27.7</p>
<p> China	    964	  6,064    - 33.7   -11.8</p>
<p> Malaysia	 253	  1,591    -  6.3   -43.4</p>
<p> Brunei	    59	    371    - 76.7   -73.5</p>
<p> Indonesia    1,294	  8,140    +  3.6   -27.0</p>
<p> Vietnam	  429	  2,698    + 26.4   +32.2</p>
<p> Mexico	   561	  3,529    + 92.9   + 1.3</p>
<p> Nigeria	  297	  1,868    +261.5    ---</p>
<p> Australia	116	    730    + 57.7   -58.7</p>
<p> Russia	     5	     31     ---	---</p>
<p> TOTAL	  21,986	138,292   +  8.4   - 1.3</p>
</text>
